    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The broad GitHub PAT grants access to all private repositories. The design is vulnerable to Exfiltration via Public Issues. While human approval is required, the prompt collapses arguments and users experience high volume, reducing effectiveness to a model summary gate. This yields a 'high' residual risk that quickly escalates to 'critical' under approval fatigue or model upgrades."
